1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
14.5
14.5

2
00:00:03,879 --> 00:00:06,879
Hi Tim. How was your holiday?
Chào Tim. Kỳ nghỉ của bạn thế nào?

3
00:00:06,879 --> 00:00:09,880
Oh, it was fantastic, thanks.
Ồ, tuyệt vời lắm, cảm ơn.

4
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,880
The hotel was great.
Khách sạn rất tuyệt.

5
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,880
There was a big swimming pool
Có một hồ bơi lớn

6
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:18,879
and there was a table tennis table too.
và cũng có một bàn bóng bàn nữa.

7
00:00:18,879 --> 00:00:23,879
Oh, that was lucky. You like table tennis.
Ồ, may mắn thật. Bạn thích bóng bàn mà.

8
00:00:23,879 --> 00:00:26,879
Was there a computer room?
Có phòng máy tính không?

9
00:00:27,759 --> 00:00:29,759
No, there wasn't.
Không, không có.

10
00:00:29,759 --> 00:00:31,759
But our room was nice.
Nhưng phòng của chúng tôi rất đẹp.

11
00:00:31,759 --> 00:00:34,759
There was a big TV in it.
Có một chiếc ti vi lớn trong phòng.

12
00:00:34,759 --> 00:00:37,759
Nice. And was there a good beach?
Tuyệt. Và có bãi biển đẹp không?

13
00:00:37,759 --> 00:00:40,759
Well, no, there wasn't.
À, không, không có.

14
00:00:40,759 --> 00:00:42,759
We weren't near the sea.
Chúng tôi không ở gần biển.

15
00:00:42,759 --> 00:00:45,759
There were mountains.
Có những ngọn núi.

16
00:00:45,759 --> 00:00:48,759
It was a very small place
Đó là một nơi rất nhỏ

17
00:00:48,759 --> 00:00:50,759
and there weren't any shops.
và không có cửa hàng nào.

18
00:00:50,759 --> 00:00:53,759
Wow! It was a small place.
Ồ! Đó là một nơi nhỏ.

19
00:00:53,759 --> 00:00:56,759
Yes. There were some cafes
Vâng. Có vài quán cà phê

20
00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:59,640
and there was a restaurant
và có một nhà hàng

21
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:04,640
and oh yes, there was a small museum.
và ồ vâng, có một bảo tàng nhỏ.

22
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:06,640
But that's it.
Nhưng chỉ có vậy thôi.

23
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:09,640
It was a bit boring really.
Thật ra hơi chán.
